[40.451871, "o", "26:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing — supporting chronology\r\n214:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n222:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n384:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n393:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — supporting chronology\r\n555:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n564:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n672:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n680:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — supporting chronology\r\n856:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output\r\n865:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — supporting chronology\r\n973:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n983:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — supporting chronology\r\n1145:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II)\r\n"]
[40.461931, "o", "1153:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) — supporting chronology\r\n1455:## Investigation Brief 09 — Mid-Year Amendment\r\n1465:## Investigation Brief 09 — Mid-Year Amendment — supporting chronology\r\n\u001b[?2004h"]
